#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1666
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The instance \"%1\" was installed from this modpack%2.\n"
"\n"
"Updating it replaces the pack's own files and keeps everything that is "
"yours: worlds, screenshots, play time and the instance's settings. Creating "
"a separate instance leaves it untouched.\n"
"\n"
"Back up anything you cannot afford to lose before updating. An update "
"replaces the pack's configuration files, and a pack that changes or removes "
"mods can leave worlds made with the older version unusable."
msgstr ""
"Instansen \"%1\" blev installeret fra denne modpack%2.\n"
"\n"
"Opdatering erstatter pakkens egne filer og holder alt, hvad der er dit: "
"verdener, skærmbilleder, spilletid og instansens indstillinger. Oprettelse "
"af en separat instans efterlader den uberørt.\n"
"\n"
"Sikkerhedskopier noget, du ikke har råd til at miste før opdatering. En "
"opdatering erstatter pakkens konfigurationsfiler, og en pakke, der ændrer "
"eller fjerner mods, kan efterlade verdener, der er lavet med den ældre "
"version ubrugelig."

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1680
#, kde-format
msgid "Update existing instance"
msgstr "Opdater eksisterende instans"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1682
#, kde-format
msgid "Create separate instance"
msgstr "Opret separat instans"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1796
#, kde-format
msgid "Delete existing save files"
msgstr "Slet eksisterende gemte filer"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1797
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The installed version of this modpack came with save files that the new "
"version no longer includes.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to remove them as part of this update? Keeping them is safe - "
"they simply stay where they are, along with any progress made in them."
msgstr ""
"Den installerede version af denne modpack kom med gemme filer, som den nye "
"version ikke længere indeholder.\n"
"\n"
"Vil du fjerne dem som en del af denne opdatering? At holde dem er sikkert - "
"de bliver simpelthen der, hvor de er, sammen med eventuelle fremskridt i dem."

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1806
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove saves"
msgstr "Fjern gemte"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1809
#, kde-format
msgid "Keep saves"
msgstr "Behold gemte"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1864
#, kde-format
msgid "No file list for the installed version"
msgstr "Ingen filliste til den installerede version"

#: launcher/InstanceImportTask.cpp:1865
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The launcher has no record of which files the installed version of this "
"modpack put into this instance, so it cannot remove the ones the new version "
"no longer ships.\n"
"\n"
"The update will work, but anything the new version dropped stays behind - "
"usually as an older copy of a mod sitting next to the one that replaced it.\n"
"\n"
"Instances installed before the launcher started keeping that record have no "
"list. This update writes one, so the update after it will be able to clean "
"up."
msgstr ""
"launcheren har ingen registrering af hvilke filer den installerede version "
"af denne modpack lagt ind i denne instans, så det ikke kan fjerne dem den "
"nye version ikke længere skibe.\n"
"\n"
"Opdateringen vil virke men noget den nye version faldt forbliver bag - "
"normalt som en ældre kopi af en mod sidder ved siden af den, der erstattede "
"den.\n"
"\n"
"Instanser installeret før launcheren begyndte at holde denne post har ingen "
"liste. Denne opdatering skriver en, så opdateringen efter den vil være i "
"stand til at rydde op."

